    "guideStep2": "Step 2 · Find the Wi-Fi / Wireless menu",
    "@guideStep2": {
        "description": "Router guide step 2 header"
    },
    "guideStep2Body": "After signing in, look for a menu called Wi-Fi, Wireless or Network Settings. Routers from different brands name it differently — the path below is for your router brand:",
